\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {One-shot confirmation on untouched data.} Official COGS development set ($n{=}3{,}000$; group-cluster paired bootstrap, 20{,}000 resamples), evaluated once with the frozen preregistered threshold and each seed's frozen best fixed depth. The compute ratios match the held-out-fold values (0.2575 / 0.2570 / 0.5212) for seeds 0--1 to the third decimal; seed 2 differs by 0.003 (0.6\% relative), so the executed-call savings transfer across splits to within a fraction of a percent.}}{10}{table.caption.18}\protected@file@percent }
